### Check the API without loading a model
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Rewrite with local Ollama (requires the model and retrieval dependencies)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/humanize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "لطفاً اسناد مربوط را تا روز دوشنبه ارسال نمایید.",
  "model": "llama3.1:8b"
}
